                      "base_doc_id": "callback-retry-contract",
                      "base_excerpt": "Protocol v1 retry contract. A 503 response with TEMPORARY_UNAVAILABLE is retriable. Retry state SCHEDULED and a trusted retry_at mean the sender will make another attempt; wait for that attempt rather than creating a parallel resend. Contact the callback operator only when the attempt limit is reached and the trusted retry state is EXHAUSTED. Correlate response request, event, order and attempt count.",
                      "base_excerpt_digest": "8a46f09d593090e628c9516f44c9e5f2e0afab8dc314b575496185bd71f6f409",
                      "base_location": "Lines 1-1",
