                      "evidence_id": "EVID-001",
                      "target_doc_id": "callback-retry-contract-v2",
                      "target_excerpt": "Protocol v2 error handling. A 503 response is retriable only when the server records a retryable failure code and a current retry policy. Retry state SCHEDULED with retry_at is still pending. EXHAUSTED is actionable only when attempt_count reaches max_attempts and the failure response digest/event/request all match the current delivery row. This document describes method; current Domain Evidence decides the incident.",
                      "target_excerpt_digest": "de606609dd942c0920ccc1114c0667417848927e7e25e38b3d089e9adf5aff2d",
